### ERP School — module APIs (after login)
### Demo school admin: GVS-ADM-0001 / ChangeMe@123
@base = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken =
@classId =
@sectionId =
@subjectId =
@slotId =
@studentId =
@sessionId =
@challanId =
@proofId =
@homeworkId =

### School dashboard
GET {{base}}/api/v1/dashboard/school
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Campuses
GET {{base}}/api/v1/campuses
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Classes
GET {{base}}/api/v1/classes
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Students
GET {{base}}/api/v1/students?size=50
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Enroll student (+ optional new parent)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/students
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Zain",
  "lastName": "Ali",
  "classId": "{{classId}}",
  "sectionId": "{{sectionId}}",
  "parentFirstName": "Imran",
  "parentLastName": "Ali",
  "relationship": "FATHER"
}

### Teacher portal
GET {{base}}/api/v1/portals/teacher
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Parent children
GET {{base}}/api/v1/parents/me/children
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Lecture roster
GET {{base}}/api/v1/attendance/lectures/{{slotId}}/roster
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Mark lecture attendance
POST {{base}}/api/v1/attendance/lectures/{{slotId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-09-14",
  "marks": [
    { "studentId": "{{studentId}}", "status": "PRESENT" }
  ]
}

### Generate monthly fee challans
POST {{base}}/api/v1/fees/challans/generate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "classId": "{{classId}}",
  "month": "2026-09-01"
}

### Student challans (parent/student)
GET {{base}}/api/v1/fees/students/{{studentId}}/challans
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Submit fee payment proof
POST {{base}}/api/v1/fees/challans/{{challanId}}/proofs
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slipUrl": "/api/v1/files/tenant/slip.pdf",
  "transactionRef": "TXN-001"
}

### Review fee proof (account officer)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/fees/proofs/{{proofId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approve": true
}

### Homework
GET {{base}}/api/v1/homework
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Submit homework (student/parent)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/homework/{{homeworkId}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileUrl": "/api/v1/files/tenant/work.pdf",
  "notes": "Completed exercises 1-10"
}

### Mark overdue fee challans
POST {{base}}/api/v1/fees/challans/mark-overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Expire overdue SaaS subscriptions (ERP Owner)
POST {{base}}/api/v1/subscriptions/expire-overdue
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Exam sessions
GET {{base}}/api/v1/exams/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Calendar
GET {{base}}/api/v1/calendar/events
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Notifications
GET {{base}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Current subscription
GET {{base}}/api/v1/subscriptions/current
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
